WEBVTT

01:30.510 --> 01:34.870
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.240 --> 01:37.789
[Episode 2]

01:40.509 --> 01:41.759
I haven't bathed in days,

01:41.759 --> 01:42.710
and I haven't even relieved myself.

01:42.710 --> 01:44.000
I just smell sour and foul—

01:44.000 --> 01:45.600
I wouldn't taste good at all.

01:46.229 --> 01:47.920
Where did the half-demon blood in you

01:47.920 --> 01:48.870
come from?

01:50.640 --> 01:52.430
What half-demon?

01:52.680 --> 01:54.039
I don't understand any of that.

01:54.039 --> 01:55.650
I'm just a commoner.

01:55.710 --> 01:56.640
A demon hunter

01:57.430 --> 01:58.960
can't be called a commoner.

02:01.760 --> 02:02.840
Those are all fake—

02:02.840 --> 02:04.840
just ordinary coarse paper.

02:04.840 --> 02:07.300
If they were real,
you'd have reacted by now.

02:09.520 --> 02:11.150
You really do stink.

02:11.150 --> 02:11.470
Mm-hmm.

02:11.470 --> 02:12.000
In that case,

02:12.000 --> 02:14.590
I'll just have to find a rat demon
to eat you.

02:15.910 --> 02:16.400
No, no,

02:16.400 --> 02:16.960
no, no, no—

02:16.960 --> 02:18.240
Boss, Cat Boss,

02:18.240 --> 02:19.280
please don't eat me.

02:19.280 --> 02:20.280
You've seen me—

02:20.280 --> 02:21.900
I have no demonic power.

02:22.240 --> 02:23.300
A swindler like you

02:23.430 --> 02:25.010
is even less worthy of living.

02:25.010 --> 02:25.900
Stop!

02:34.030 --> 02:35.590
Since you claim not to be a demon hunter,

02:35.590 --> 02:36.870
what is your name?

02:37.720 --> 02:38.780
Where is your home?

02:40.190 --> 02:41.850
Is anyone else in your family?

02:44.630 --> 02:45.920
My name is Xiao Yao.

02:46.079 --> 02:47.630
It's just my father and me in my family.

02:47.630 --> 02:49.960
My father used to be a hunter in Wenling,

02:50.150 --> 02:52.000
but then the magistrate's office
forced us to catch demons.

02:52.000 --> 02:54.150
W-We didn't know how to catch a demon,
and we didn't understand any of it.

02:54.150 --> 02:55.150
I had no choice

02:55.150 --> 02:57.120
but to team up with some fellow villagers

02:57.120 --> 02:59.280
to scam people—just to get by.

02:59.630 --> 03:01.090
What is your date of birth?

03:01.400 --> 03:02.160
I don't know.

03:02.560 --> 03:03.870
I really don't know.

03:03.870 --> 03:05.710
My mother died
right after giving birth to me.

03:05.710 --> 03:07.800
My father said he just remembers

03:07.800 --> 03:08.750
it was a winter night,

03:08.750 --> 03:10.030
heavy snow falling,

03:10.030 --> 03:12.030
and when the wind blew,
plum blossoms swirled into the room—

03:12.030 --> 03:13.290
that's when I was born.

03:13.310 --> 03:14.840
Really, I'm not lying.

03:16.470 --> 03:17.800
What do you want from me?

03:40.540 --> 03:41.490
Now

03:41.950 --> 03:44.060
you can never lose me.

03:44.430 --> 03:45.710
No matter where I go,

03:46.060 --> 03:47.720
no matter how many years pass—

03:47.970 --> 03:49.600
you will always find me.

03:51.670 --> 03:53.079
If you must kill me, then kill me—

03:53.079 --> 03:55.170
but do not dishonor me,

04:00.750 --> 04:02.420
my lord demon.

04:10.800 --> 04:11.590
My Lord,

04:12.330 --> 04:14.370
it seems she is not Ning'an.

04:15.840 --> 04:16.870
Please rest now

04:17.430 --> 04:18.560
and leave

04:18.800 --> 04:20.320
the rest to me.

04:22.100 --> 04:23.020
No need.

04:26.480 --> 04:27.720
My Lord,

04:28.080 --> 04:30.710
she merely resembles Ning'an. That is all.

04:33.480 --> 04:35.510
Excuse me, have you all
come to an agreement?

04:35.510 --> 04:37.310
Is it possible to release me now?

04:43.070 --> 04:43.870
Thank you so much!

04:43.870 --> 04:45.130
What a truly good soul—

04:45.190 --> 04:46.450
no, a truly good demon!

04:52.800 --> 04:54.730
Find two minor demons to guard her.

04:54.950 --> 04:55.830
Once it's done,

04:56.409 --> 04:56.950
come find me.

04:56.950 --> 04:57.680
Yes, My Lord.

05:02.360 --> 05:03.000
My Lord,

05:03.830 --> 05:05.990
Ning'an is dead.

05:06.310 --> 05:08.270
Xiao Mu saw it with his own eyes.

05:09.040 --> 05:10.240
This woman

05:10.240 --> 05:11.920
may seem unusual,

05:11.920 --> 05:12.950
but I swear

05:13.720 --> 05:15.600
she is not Ning'an.

05:16.920 --> 05:17.920
Switch to Xiao Mu.

05:18.630 --> 05:20.040
My Lord, you...

05:20.430 --> 05:20.950
You...

05:23.240 --> 05:24.770
I, Xiao Mu, am here, My Lord.

05:24.800 --> 05:26.510
Tell me everything

05:28.510 --> 05:30.170
that happened after my death—

05:31.450 --> 05:33.580
every detail, without missing a word.

05:50.560 --> 05:51.680
The best decision

05:53.480 --> 05:55.800
I ever made in this life

05:57.600 --> 05:59.870
was meeting you.

06:20.560 --> 06:22.090
After the crowd dispersed,

06:22.120 --> 06:23.750
I retrieved your clothes—

06:24.480 --> 06:27.120
still carrying a trace
of your primordial spirit—

06:27.120 --> 06:30.660
intending to return to Demons' Valley
and preserve it with care.

06:30.660 --> 06:32.920
But by then, the demons in Demons' Valley

06:33.190 --> 06:35.130
had already been slaughtered by humans.

06:35.130 --> 06:37.070
I had no choice but to seal your spirit

06:37.070 --> 06:39.560
within an ancient tree deep in the heart
of Qingyuan Mountain.

06:39.560 --> 06:41.170
Drawing upon
the mountain's spiritual energy

06:41.170 --> 06:43.159
and your cultivation,

06:43.159 --> 06:44.830
it would have taken only 300 years

06:44.830 --> 06:46.430
for you to regain human form.

06:47.500 --> 06:48.360
Over the years,

06:48.720 --> 06:51.690
demons have been hunted
nearly to extinction by humans.

06:51.690 --> 06:54.140
The survivors each
harbor their own agendas.

06:54.140 --> 06:55.840
I gathered those minor demons who hadn't
yet awakened their spiritual awareness

06:55.840 --> 06:57.270
back to the one small corner
of Demons' Valley

06:57.270 --> 06:58.950
that remained untouched,

06:59.600 --> 07:01.460
trained them
to strengthen their power,

07:01.460 --> 07:03.320
and prepared for your awakening.

07:03.780 --> 07:05.440
But just a century had passed,

07:05.940 --> 07:07.570
and who could have foreseen

07:07.600 --> 07:10.040
that this woman would
disturb your primordial spirit…

07:10.040 --> 07:11.300
You have endured much.

07:12.760 --> 07:13.360
My Lord,

07:15.480 --> 07:16.880
my life—Xiao Ming's too—

07:17.390 --> 07:18.390
was given by you.

07:19.160 --> 07:20.160
Without you,

07:20.800 --> 07:22.730
we would have remained stray cats,

07:22.990 --> 07:24.720
abused and forgotten,

07:24.980 --> 07:27.240
living out mere years in the human realm.

07:28.920 --> 07:30.970
So anything we do for you

07:31.070 --> 07:32.530
is only what we ought to do.

07:34.570 --> 07:35.300
It's just...

07:37.400 --> 07:40.390
now that you have been forcibly awakened
before your time,

07:40.390 --> 07:42.270
your three souls and seven spirits
have not yet fully returned.

07:42.270 --> 07:44.730
Your spiritual power
is greatly diminished

07:44.750 --> 07:46.750
and will require daily cultivation

07:46.750 --> 07:48.270
to restore it swiftly.

07:49.750 --> 07:51.750
To regain my power rapidly,

07:52.980 --> 07:54.240
the most effective way

07:55.890 --> 07:58.460
is to find the Yuli Spring
before the humans do

07:59.930 --> 08:01.190
and claim it for my own.

08:02.950 --> 08:04.510
But to locate the Yuli Spring,

08:04.510 --> 08:07.110
I still need the guidance
of the Kunlun Mirror.

08:07.120 --> 08:08.220
The ancient Kunlun Mirror

08:08.220 --> 08:10.480
was shattered on the day of your wedding,

08:10.680 --> 08:12.750
its fragments scattered
across the three realms.

08:12.750 --> 08:14.080
In these hundred years,

08:14.120 --> 08:17.050
only you have ever succeeded
in finding pieces of the mirror.

08:17.050 --> 08:20.070
Now, every clan is growing desperate
in their search for the Yuli Spring—

08:20.070 --> 08:21.560
especially since your awakening

08:21.560 --> 08:23.750
has also stirred the reappearance
of the Dreamshard.

08:23.750 --> 08:26.400
If you leave Demons' Valley now
to seek the mirror,

08:26.400 --> 08:29.310
you will become a target for all.
It is far too dangerous.

08:29.310 --> 08:30.240
We implore you

08:30.870 --> 08:33.240
to remain in the valley
and recover your strength for now.

08:33.240 --> 08:34.940
My Lord, My Lord—

08:35.030 --> 08:36.559
the human girl has escaped!

08:36.870 --> 08:37.909
How could you let this happen?

08:37.909 --> 08:39.240
Weren't you told
to keep a close watch on her?

08:39.240 --> 08:40.000
How could she escape?

08:40.000 --> 08:41.080
She said she needed to relieve herself.

08:41.080 --> 08:42.200
If we didn't let her out,

08:42.200 --> 08:44.460
she threatened to do it right
in the room.

09:26.390 --> 09:27.510
Hey, little ones,

09:30.150 --> 09:32.370
why did you take my bag?

09:33.040 --> 09:35.170
Tell your friends
to give it back to me.

10:03.680 --> 10:05.070
So this is your hideout?

10:10.480 --> 10:11.630
How adorable...

10:27.960 --> 10:28.960
Sorry about that,

10:29.040 --> 10:29.630
um—

10:30.760 --> 10:32.580
I'll fix it for you right now.

10:33.870 --> 10:35.790
Stop hitting me, and I'll fix it!

10:42.550 --> 10:43.320
I'm really sorry!

10:43.320 --> 10:45.380
I'll help repair this bridge for you.

10:47.270 --> 10:48.270
Looks like it can't really

10:48.270 --> 10:49.580
be fixed after all…

10:49.600 --> 10:51.200
Um, maybe you should fix it yourselves.

10:51.200 --> 10:53.660
W-Who told you
to snatch my bag first anyway?

10:53.660 --> 10:55.920
Next time, I'll help you fix it properly.

11:13.200 --> 11:14.080
Um,

11:14.360 --> 11:15.630
sorry, sorry—

11:15.630 --> 11:16.630
it wasn't on purpose.

11:16.630 --> 11:17.360
I just

11:17.360 --> 11:19.970
accidentally broke them,

11:20.200 --> 11:21.920
but it was your little ones

11:22.360 --> 11:24.050
who snatched my bag first!

11:29.440 --> 11:32.440
Next time I have a chance,
I'll help you fix it for real!

11:34.630 --> 11:35.750
Stop chasing me!

11:36.600 --> 11:38.180
I already said I'd help you!

11:40.670 --> 11:41.990
Demons, begone!

11:42.720 --> 11:43.760
Blast you!

11:45.360 --> 11:46.380
Blast you all!

11:46.670 --> 11:47.840
Dad!

11:51.720 --> 11:53.120
I'll blast you to pieces!

12:19.480 --> 12:21.080
She disappeared right here.

12:21.610 --> 12:22.510
My Lord,

12:22.620 --> 12:24.020
there's no need to worry.

12:24.030 --> 12:25.150
With her level of skill,

12:25.150 --> 12:27.630
she could never breach the barrier
of Demons' Valley.

12:27.630 --> 12:29.230
But given her level of skill,

12:29.500 --> 12:32.570
she'd be in danger if she
encountered a demon with ill intentions.

12:32.570 --> 12:34.230
It is time to gather all demons

12:34.480 --> 12:36.290
back under my command.

13:01.200 --> 13:02.870
I finally found this place!

13:06.320 --> 13:07.920
Until our paths cross again!

13:32.510 --> 13:33.530
What's going on?

13:49.270 --> 13:50.750
How unusual—

13:51.440 --> 13:54.450
a being from another race
has actually entered Demons' Valley.

13:54.450 --> 13:57.370
[Hei Wu]

13:55.840 --> 13:57.500
How did you cross the barrier?

13:57.840 --> 13:59.640
And how many others are with you?

15:05.870 --> 15:07.130
All of you—stand down!

15:16.030 --> 15:17.250
A century has passed,

15:17.390 --> 15:19.520
Demon Lord, I trust you have been well.

15:19.780 --> 15:21.720
A century ago,
you were defeated by my hand.

15:21.720 --> 15:23.830
I ordered you to cultivate
in the Pipa Cave

15:23.830 --> 15:25.840
and refrain from meddling
in demon affairs.

15:25.840 --> 15:27.680
Why have you left without permission?

15:27.680 --> 15:29.650
Well, with the Demon Lord absent,

15:29.680 --> 15:31.070
chaos spread among our demon kind.

15:31.070 --> 15:32.850
I merely guarded this last stretch

15:32.850 --> 15:35.050
of land in Demons' Valley in your stead.

15:40.300 --> 15:43.800
Demon Lord,
congratulations on regaining human form.

15:43.830 --> 15:45.230
Now that I have returned,

15:45.270 --> 15:47.470
the demons shall be under my care again.

15:47.630 --> 15:48.360
Come with me.

15:48.370 --> 15:49.030
Not so fast.

15:50.330 --> 15:51.930
This outsider girl

15:52.000 --> 15:54.060
carries demon-repelling artifacts on her

15:54.060 --> 15:55.720
and trespassed into Demons' Valley—

15:55.720 --> 15:57.590
clearly she bears ill will
toward our demon kind.

15:57.590 --> 16:00.280
I, Hei Wu, dare not question
the Demon Lord,

16:00.360 --> 16:02.720
but neither can I ignore a threat
to the demon kind.

16:02.720 --> 16:04.390
What would you have us do?

16:05.240 --> 16:08.170
I didn't even want to come here—
I'll leave right now.

16:15.040 --> 16:16.220
How I act requires

16:16.790 --> 16:18.240
no commentary from you.

16:18.870 --> 16:19.600
Demon Lord,

16:20.390 --> 16:23.120
mercy and softness will not
achieve great deeds.

16:23.480 --> 16:25.550
Or perhaps your will
outruns your strength.

16:25.550 --> 16:27.390
If you cannot ensure
the safety of Demons' Valley,

16:27.390 --> 16:28.030
I, Hei Wu,

16:28.480 --> 16:30.880
am willing to act in your stead,
Demon Lord.

16:51.550 --> 16:53.150
The "great deed" you speak of

16:53.910 --> 16:55.640
is nothing but the Yuli Spring.

16:56.240 --> 16:57.430
As your Demon Lord,

16:58.050 --> 17:00.070
I will lead you to the spring

17:00.660 --> 17:02.790
and help all demons
attain full power.

17:02.890 --> 17:05.390
But if you harbor any other ambitions,

17:06.069 --> 17:07.910
I'm happy to show you exactly

17:08.400 --> 17:10.960
how ruthless I can be.

17:11.069 --> 17:13.030
Yes, my Lord.

17:19.349 --> 17:19.920
What—

17:20.790 --> 17:22.790
do you still wish to stay among them?

17:36.160 --> 17:37.930
Just now he clearly suffered damage
to his spiritual power,

17:37.930 --> 17:38.790
yet he still...

17:40.590 --> 17:41.550
Forgive my incompetence.

17:40.730 --> 17:43.220
[Wu Huan]

17:42.020 --> 17:43.480
Forgive my incompetence.

17:45.550 --> 17:47.950
Hong Ye remains a force
to be reckoned with.

18:03.390 --> 18:04.520
Are you hurt as well?

18:04.910 --> 18:06.030
Why would I be hurt?

18:08.350 --> 18:08.920
My Lord,

18:09.480 --> 18:09.920
I…

18:12.280 --> 18:14.480
I, Xiao Ming, will take my leave for now.

18:15.390 --> 18:18.320
If you need anything,
please remember to call for me.

18:42.790 --> 18:44.310
You—what are you doing?

18:44.330 --> 18:45.200
Let go of me!

18:45.350 --> 18:46.240
Let go!

18:46.240 --> 18:46.880
Y-You…

18:47.270 --> 18:48.590
I never expected the exalted Demon Lord

18:48.590 --> 18:50.920
to stoop so low
as to bully an ordinary girl!

18:50.920 --> 18:52.880
Are you truly an ordinary girl?

18:53.110 --> 18:53.510
I…

18:54.000 --> 18:54.590
you…

19:00.290 --> 19:02.090
Fine, I am not an ordinary woman—

19:02.810 --> 19:04.270
and I suggest you release me.

19:04.270 --> 19:06.030
If you don't, then I'll—

19:07.830 --> 19:08.790
You'll what?

19:18.440 --> 19:19.440
Stop right there.

19:21.000 --> 19:21.960
As a demon,

19:22.230 --> 19:23.890
yet knowing no demonic arts,

19:23.980 --> 19:25.840
you should remain in Demons' Valley

19:25.840 --> 19:28.370
and properly learn
to wield spiritual power.

19:30.350 --> 19:31.640
That's ridiculous.

19:32.060 --> 19:34.160
I was perfectly fine in the human realm—

19:34.160 --> 19:36.350
first dragged here for no reason,

19:36.480 --> 19:37.680
and now you want me

19:37.680 --> 19:38.880
to study demonic arts out of nowhere.

19:38.880 --> 19:40.110
I'm human.

19:40.130 --> 19:41.590
You were able to awaken me,

19:42.110 --> 19:43.710
which proves you are a demon,

19:43.720 --> 19:44.640
not human.

19:45.790 --> 19:47.720
The only reason
I've kept you alive until now

19:47.720 --> 19:49.980
is because demon blood flows within you.

19:50.640 --> 19:51.270
You might

19:51.810 --> 19:53.670
as well accept it—you are a demon.

19:53.750 --> 19:55.000
I was born of my mother

19:55.000 --> 19:55.750
and raised by my father.

19:55.750 --> 19:56.880
I am not a demon.

19:57.070 --> 19:58.830
Demons eat people—I don't.

19:59.510 --> 20:00.700
Demons eat people—

20:00.750 --> 20:01.770
Yet you do not.

20:05.470 --> 20:06.990
Say that again.

20:11.030 --> 20:11.590
Just

20:13.310 --> 20:14.720
who are you?

20:30.440 --> 20:31.220
Ning'an,

20:32.110 --> 20:34.970
I have recovered the ancient Kunlun Mirror
for you.

20:35.070 --> 20:36.480
All that came before

20:36.680 --> 20:39.440
was merely to unsettle your mind.

20:41.590 --> 20:42.240
Ning'an,

20:43.590 --> 20:44.660
toward me,

20:45.240 --> 20:47.100
have you ever felt anything true?

21:19.030 --> 21:20.160
From this day forth,

21:21.590 --> 21:23.990
you are forbidden
to leave Demons' Valley.

21:24.910 --> 21:27.910
Take one step beyond it,
and you will be shown no mercy.

21:32.960 --> 21:33.550
Move!

21:45.720 --> 21:46.270
My Lord!

21:47.310 --> 21:48.110
It's nothing.

21:49.030 --> 21:50.610
I sustained a minor injury

21:50.790 --> 21:53.520
during the earlier clash with Hei Wu—
that is all.

22:11.590 --> 22:12.480
Who are you?

22:12.920 --> 22:13.830
I'm Luoluo,

22:13.670 --> 22:15.410
[Luoluo]

22:13.830 --> 22:14.750
and she's Dali.

22:14.830 --> 22:15.790
The Lord sent us

22:16.110 --> 22:17.350
to bring you something to eat.

22:17.350 --> 22:17.880
Mm-hmm.

22:18.310 --> 22:19.030
Eat up.

22:19.830 --> 22:20.760
It's delicious.

22:28.690 --> 22:29.750
[Dali]

22:35.570 --> 22:36.700
Here, have some too.

22:37.830 --> 22:39.490
He won't eat—he's not hungry.

22:41.950 --> 22:43.160
Just you eat.

22:45.210 --> 22:46.540
Then I won't eat either.

22:49.070 --> 22:49.870
What's wrong?

22:51.660 --> 22:53.060
It's poisoned, isn't it?

22:53.110 --> 22:54.480
It's not poisoned. Eat.

23:02.000 --> 23:03.330
Enough now—put it down.

23:10.740 --> 23:12.400
He's waiting for you outside.

23:16.510 --> 23:17.840
Can I borrow something?

23:18.480 --> 23:19.270
Borrow what?

23:35.030 --> 23:36.640
Why are you dressed like that?

23:36.640 --> 23:37.590
I've noticed you demons

23:37.590 --> 23:39.250
always seem to aim for my neck.

23:40.550 --> 23:41.680
Are your wounds any better?

23:41.680 --> 23:43.410
I've recovered from the wound,

23:44.000 --> 23:45.480
but my body aches.

23:45.640 --> 23:47.200
That bed of yours is way too hard—

23:47.200 --> 23:48.350
my back just can't…

23:48.750 --> 23:49.550
But it's fine, really.

23:49.550 --> 23:50.790
Just let me go

23:50.790 --> 23:52.050
and the pain will stop.

23:55.880 --> 23:56.480
Follow me.

24:11.680 --> 24:12.400
Do you know

24:13.190 --> 24:15.450
that all living things possess a spirit?

24:16.470 --> 24:17.160
I do.

24:18.330 --> 24:18.960
Demons

24:20.720 --> 24:23.920
are born from the cultivation
of all beings in this world.

24:24.360 --> 24:27.140
For a demon, the path of cultivation
is exceptionally difficult.

24:27.140 --> 24:28.940
One must possess innate wisdom,

24:29.670 --> 24:31.510
draw upon the essence
of heaven and earth,

24:31.510 --> 24:33.510
follow the laws of nature's cycles,

24:34.860 --> 24:36.950
endure countless seasons and moons—

24:37.790 --> 24:39.650
only then may one take human form.

24:40.350 --> 24:41.160
Even so,

24:42.350 --> 24:44.010
they must still evade pursuit

24:44.120 --> 24:46.120
from both humans and their own kind.

24:48.110 --> 24:52.110
Are you going to tell me the history
of Demons' Valley?

24:55.340 --> 24:56.820
I want you to understand

24:57.110 --> 24:59.170
that the demon race, like human race,

24:59.350 --> 25:01.300
is also a unique part of this world.

25:02.970 --> 25:04.070
You're right.

25:05.750 --> 25:07.790
But I'm still human, not a demon.

25:07.790 --> 25:10.250
That's a distinction
that can't be blurred.

25:14.370 --> 25:15.680
Whatever you believe,

25:16.780 --> 25:19.510
you are ultimately different
from other humans.

25:19.750 --> 25:21.480
People will not accept demons—

25:21.760 --> 25:23.360
and they will not accept you.

25:23.960 --> 25:26.180
Now that you've entered Demons' Valley,

25:26.180 --> 25:29.980
you already carry an aura
of demonic energy that cannot be cleansed.

25:31.070 --> 25:32.360
How is that possible?

25:32.590 --> 25:33.720
Don't lie to me—

25:33.720 --> 25:35.520
how could I have demonic energy?

25:35.720 --> 25:36.680
Then tell me,

25:37.480 --> 25:39.270
Then tell me: why did Luoluo and Dali

25:39.270 --> 25:40.960
not recognize you as human?

25:45.790 --> 25:47.850
Humans will see you as an aberration—

25:47.930 --> 25:49.010
they will fear you,

25:49.830 --> 25:50.790
scorn you,

25:51.270 --> 25:52.720
and even seek your death.

25:53.350 --> 25:55.080
What if the one I'm about to kill

25:55.490 --> 25:56.550
is a demon?

25:56.800 --> 25:58.050
She is not a demon.

25:58.440 --> 26:01.190
Many people came to my home,
splashed dog blood,

26:01.540 --> 26:05.200
drove us from place to place—
hunted and reviled wherever we went.

26:12.160 --> 26:14.360
Don't talk as if you know humans so well.

26:19.920 --> 26:22.180
Better than you humans know yourselves.

26:30.000 --> 26:31.550
As the ruler of all demons,

26:32.570 --> 26:36.230
I am also responsible for the lives
of every demon under my charge.

26:36.400 --> 26:37.270
If you leave,

26:38.110 --> 26:39.440
the demons will believe

26:40.070 --> 26:42.470
Demons' Valley
has been exposed to danger.

26:42.750 --> 26:44.480
That is why I will not let you go.

26:45.740 --> 26:47.140
Let me offer you

26:48.200 --> 26:50.830
well-meant advice:
accept my proposal gladly,

26:50.830 --> 26:52.450
settle here in Demons' Valley.

26:52.450 --> 26:54.110
I will arrange lessons for you

26:54.240 --> 26:56.070
so you may soon cultivate spiritual power

26:56.070 --> 26:58.270
and learn to conceal your demonic aura.

26:58.440 --> 26:59.100
After that,

26:59.880 --> 27:03.140
both the demon realm and the human realm
will be open to you.

27:04.130 --> 27:05.590
And if I insist on leaving?

27:09.120 --> 27:09.980
Suit yourself.

27:27.880 --> 27:28.920
Hello, everyone.

27:32.410 --> 27:34.010
Don't attack. Don't attack.

27:38.030 --> 27:39.190
I'm Xiao Yao.

27:39.440 --> 27:40.730
Last time was my fault—

27:40.830 --> 27:43.520
I accidentally damaged your place,

27:43.590 --> 27:45.390
but I'm here to make up for it now.

27:46.310 --> 27:47.350
Really, I mean it.

27:47.350 --> 27:49.110
Look, I've even brought tools.

27:50.160 --> 27:50.820
The bridge.

27:54.070 --> 27:56.520
Well, I'll be staying here
for a few days.

27:56.680 --> 27:58.110
Since fate has brought us together,

27:58.110 --> 28:00.000
how about we get along peacefully?

28:00.000 --> 28:00.590
Alright,

28:00.610 --> 28:02.070
come over and give it a try.

28:09.410 --> 28:10.510
You know, I noticed

28:10.510 --> 28:12.240
something's missing around here.

28:12.240 --> 28:14.240
This time I'll build you a fence too—

28:15.320 --> 28:17.120
that'll make things even safer.

28:23.710 --> 28:24.440
Sorry, sorry—

28:24.440 --> 28:26.240
that wasn't on purpose, really!

28:26.350 --> 28:27.750
Who built your house last time anyway?

28:27.750 --> 28:28.960
It's not very sturdy.

28:29.550 --> 28:31.070
But don't worry—now that I'm here,

28:31.070 --> 28:32.400
I'll make sure your home

28:32.400 --> 28:33.660
won't budge even in wind

28:33.660 --> 28:34.740
or rain.

29:31.750 --> 29:32.680
There, all done…

29:36.310 --> 29:36.880
Alright, good.

29:36.880 --> 29:38.410
From now on, we're friends!

29:40.310 --> 29:41.400
Do they have names?

29:42.510 --> 29:43.170
Zhuyu herb.

29:43.960 --> 29:44.650
Zhuyu herb?

29:45.350 --> 29:47.350
That sounds like the name of a plant.

29:47.480 --> 29:50.810
Zhuyu herb originally grew
as spirit herb on Mount Zhaoyao.

29:51.110 --> 29:52.640
That land is harsh and cold,

29:53.510 --> 29:55.640
making cultivation there
extremely difficult.

29:55.640 --> 29:57.960
Yet Zhuyu herb possesses
remarkable properties—

29:57.960 --> 30:01.560
if humans consume it, they can go 7 days
without hunger or thirst.

30:01.910 --> 30:03.640
Because of that, in this world,

30:03.910 --> 30:08.240
the Zhuyu herb has been driven nearly
to extinction by human overharvesting.

30:11.830 --> 30:13.090
Only these few remain,

30:14.070 --> 30:15.730
having fled to Demons' Valley

30:16.920 --> 30:19.050
to escape becoming human sustenance.

30:20.770 --> 30:22.610
So you're edible.

30:31.640 --> 30:32.890
If you apply yourself in your lessons,

30:32.890 --> 30:34.070
you may return to the human realm

30:34.070 --> 30:35.070
in just a few days.

30:59.440 --> 31:00.570
Whew, just on time.

31:04.090 --> 31:05.890
Why are you taking my spot again?

31:07.720 --> 31:08.440
Get out of here!

31:08.440 --> 31:09.030
You get out!

31:09.030 --> 31:09.830
Move over already.

31:09.830 --> 31:11.240
Go, go!

31:11.240 --> 31:12.030
Who are you cheering for?

31:12.030 --> 31:12.830
Come on!

31:13.030 --> 31:13.640
Try one.

31:14.000 --> 31:16.560
Do I really have to be
in the same class as these guys?

31:16.120 --> 31:18.040
[Bamboo]

31:16.680 --> 31:17.830
So sour.

31:17.830 --> 31:18.720
That can't be right.

31:18.720 --> 31:19.860
Try another piece.

31:29.030 --> 31:30.090
What are you doing?

31:30.160 --> 31:31.550
Just making sure you're not late.

31:31.550 --> 31:31.960
I...

31:31.960 --> 31:32.510
Look,

31:33.000 --> 31:34.640
the crane's still flying.

31:36.070 --> 31:37.660
You lot who can fly—

31:37.790 --> 31:38.890
and live close by—

31:39.000 --> 31:40.550
why can't you ever come early?

31:40.550 --> 31:41.950
You are always late.

31:42.070 --> 31:43.240
Don't you feel guilty?

31:43.240 --> 31:44.370
Aren't you ashamed?

31:50.790 --> 31:52.440
It's your fault for having to eat—

31:52.440 --> 31:53.270
now we're late!

31:53.270 --> 31:54.720
If you don't eat,
how do you have the strength to study?

31:54.720 --> 31:55.510
Here, take it.

31:55.510 --> 31:56.200
Xiao Yao!

31:56.680 --> 31:58.030
you're here! Come over.

31:59.510 --> 32:00.640
You're early!

32:00.670 --> 32:01.600
Give me the book.

32:02.270 --> 32:02.790
This—

32:03.000 --> 32:03.590
This is yours.

32:03.590 --> 32:04.920
Right, this is your seat.

32:04.920 --> 32:05.680
This is mine.

32:05.680 --> 32:07.000
-And this is Luoluo's seat.
-This is mine.

32:07.000 --> 32:08.460
Everyone, gather around!

32:08.550 --> 32:10.810
-Hurry, hurry!
-We have a new classmate.

32:11.110 --> 32:11.600
Come over!

32:11.600 --> 32:12.800
Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!

32:13.000 --> 32:14.790
You're all still

32:15.400 --> 32:17.830
minor demons
who haven't fully taken human form.

32:17.830 --> 32:18.400
Mm-hmm.

32:18.640 --> 32:19.570
Mm-hmm.

32:20.960 --> 32:23.680
I told you this would hold me back!

32:23.830 --> 32:25.110
I've said so to the Lord—

32:25.110 --> 32:26.350
but he insisted I be

32:26.350 --> 32:27.550
in the same class as you.

32:27.550 --> 32:29.160
We really shouldn't be classmates.

32:29.160 --> 32:31.690
Or maybe you're just afraid
to be in our class—

32:32.200 --> 32:33.790
afraid we'll find out

32:38.850 --> 32:41.070
the Lord has been granting you
private tutelage.

32:41.070 --> 32:42.240
Yeah, for sure—

32:42.240 --> 32:43.160
extra lessons behind our backs.

32:43.160 --> 32:43.590
Right,

32:43.590 --> 32:44.070
definitely.

32:44.070 --> 32:44.720
I knew it.

32:44.830 --> 32:47.160
We've been training for years
and still look like this.

32:47.160 --> 32:48.550
Sweating now, aren't you?

32:48.550 --> 32:49.640
What kind of demon are you anyway?

32:49.640 --> 32:52.350
Yes, if we can't even tell your true form,
something's off.

32:52.350 --> 32:53.070
Look!

32:55.400 --> 32:56.720
My true form

32:56.920 --> 32:57.720
is

32:58.480 --> 33:00.160
a white snake.

33:01.070 --> 33:01.950
A Snake?

33:02.160 --> 33:05.160
It was a night of falling blossoms.

33:05.680 --> 33:07.730
I was lost in the forest,

33:08.110 --> 33:09.960
hunted by human trappers.

33:10.110 --> 33:11.710
At the most perilous moment,

33:11.790 --> 33:15.640
a hero in blue robes descended
from the heavens

33:15.640 --> 33:17.370
and saved me from certain doom.

33:22.400 --> 33:25.450
A hero in blue robes…

33:25.510 --> 33:26.480
Could that be the Lord?

33:26.480 --> 33:27.960
Shh!

33:28.200 --> 33:31.070
The Lord told me not to speak of it—
so don't ask more.

33:31.070 --> 33:31.720
We can't say that. We can't.

33:31.720 --> 33:33.510
Xiao Yao,

33:33.750 --> 33:36.550
that mouth of yours
certainly doesn't go to waste.

33:36.680 --> 33:38.340
Can't stop boasting, can you?

33:39.440 --> 33:40.160
True.

33:40.750 --> 33:41.310
Right?

33:43.480 --> 33:44.030
My Lord.

33:45.480 --> 33:46.920
Do you have something to do?

33:46.920 --> 33:48.510
I—well, yes.

33:49.030 --> 33:51.000
I was just worried the Lord
might be concerned,

33:51.000 --> 33:52.930
so I came specially to check and see

33:53.030 --> 33:54.340
if she was holding her own.

33:54.340 --> 33:55.750
With that sharp tongue of hers,

33:55.750 --> 33:56.750
why would I worry?

33:59.000 --> 34:01.510
If you are not worried,

34:01.510 --> 34:03.070
then why come here

34:03.070 --> 34:05.000
instead of cultivating properly?

34:12.190 --> 34:13.030
My Lord—

34:13.190 --> 34:14.520
I'm sorry! My Lord!

34:14.670 --> 34:16.550
Please put me down, My Lord!

34:19.320 --> 34:20.520
You're a white snake?

34:20.840 --> 34:21.300
Mm-hmm.

34:22.510 --> 34:24.170
Then can I give you something?

34:24.840 --> 34:26.170
A welcoming gift?

34:30.960 --> 34:31.960
You don't like it?

34:33.710 --> 34:35.469
I do,

34:35.800 --> 34:37.320
but I've quit that.

34:37.320 --> 34:39.190
Nowadays I only eat humans.

34:40.360 --> 34:41.199
You eat humans!

34:41.199 --> 34:42.230
Y-You eat humans?

34:42.230 --> 34:43.190
You're amazing!

34:43.190 --> 34:44.030
She actually eats humans!

34:44.030 --> 34:46.190
Only Xiaohu's father once ate humans.

34:46.190 --> 34:46.710
Mm-hmm.

34:46.960 --> 34:47.570
right.

34:52.190 --> 34:53.230
Hey, you! Talk properly.

34:53.230 --> 34:55.280
Well, my dad said

34:55.280 --> 34:56.320
human flesh

34:56.510 --> 34:57.360
is sour—

34:57.670 --> 34:59.130
doesn't taste good at all.

34:59.190 --> 35:00.480
It's just nothing special.

35:00.480 --> 35:01.070
Right?

35:01.630 --> 35:03.230
Your father doesn't care
for eating humans.

35:03.230 --> 35:04.210
Of course not.

35:04.590 --> 35:05.590
My dad also said

35:06.000 --> 35:06.630
they just

35:06.960 --> 35:08.880
act fierce and scary

35:08.880 --> 35:10.140
to intimidate humans.

35:10.280 --> 35:11.730
Humans are terrifying.

35:11.920 --> 35:12.800
Yes, that's right.

35:12.800 --> 35:14.130
I remember my mom saying

35:14.150 --> 35:15.670
humans eat everything raw or cooked—

35:15.670 --> 35:17.190
anything can end up in their mouths.

35:17.190 --> 35:17.880
True.

35:18.110 --> 35:20.480
Lots of demons have
ended up in human stomachs.

35:20.480 --> 35:21.110
Yeah,

35:21.110 --> 35:22.710
and they eat us the most!

35:22.710 --> 35:24.230
Right, and they have
so many ways to cook us…

35:24.230 --> 35:25.710
Stir-fried, boiled…

35:26.320 --> 35:27.840
Don't scare yourselves like that.

35:27.840 --> 35:29.190
Actually, humans

35:29.190 --> 35:30.760
don't just eat demons.

35:30.760 --> 35:33.290
-They eat lots of things.
-The Master's here.

35:33.760 --> 35:34.760
Now,

35:35.070 --> 35:36.840
I have a question for you.

35:37.510 --> 35:40.070
Who knows what

35:40.190 --> 35:42.960
the true form of a Bi Fang is?

35:46.710 --> 35:48.360
Who...

35:49.070 --> 35:49.740
Xiao Yao,

35:50.190 --> 35:51.280
you answer.

35:50.260 --> 35:51.210
[King of Eight Plates]

35:57.030 --> 35:58.020
Still not ready?

35:58.280 --> 35:59.150
Don't rush.

35:59.150 --> 36:01.840
Softshell turtle soup needs
to simmer even longer.

36:01.840 --> 36:02.900
Softshell turtle?

36:03.230 --> 36:04.290
Where'd you get it?

36:04.590 --> 36:06.390
Our master is a turtle, isn't he?

36:08.920 --> 36:09.910
Sir.

36:10.070 --> 36:10.920
Sir.

36:10.920 --> 36:12.210
The Master is gone.

36:13.660 --> 36:14.320
No,

36:14.710 --> 36:16.360
I just snipped a bit of his beard

36:16.360 --> 36:17.800
while he was asleep.

36:19.030 --> 36:20.440
If there's a next time,

36:20.550 --> 36:23.170
I will banish you
from Moon-Gazing Terrace.

36:24.190 --> 36:26.590
Goodbye, Master.

36:33.230 --> 36:35.050
Dali, you're so delicious.

36:35.550 --> 36:36.750
Don't talk nonsense—

36:36.760 --> 36:38.400
this is a flower pastry Xiao Yao made

36:38.400 --> 36:39.510
from fallen petals.

36:39.510 --> 36:40.320
Is it tasty?

36:40.400 --> 36:41.320
Mmm, it's delicious.

36:41.320 --> 36:42.000
Delicious.

36:42.000 --> 36:42.620
Tasty.

36:45.510 --> 36:46.760
A simple trick.

36:46.840 --> 36:47.550
It smells nice, doesn't it?

36:47.550 --> 36:48.500
So sweet.

36:48.800 --> 36:49.860
Here, have a taste.

36:50.320 --> 36:51.520
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

36:52.400 --> 36:53.000
I-I—

36:53.880 --> 36:55.080
you have so many here…

36:56.400 --> 36:57.330
today I-I'll...

36:58.040 --> 36:58.610
I'll...

37:03.880 --> 37:04.610
Little deer,

37:04.800 --> 37:07.730
are you willing to offer
a small piece of your antler?

37:07.880 --> 37:08.460
Alright.

37:09.000 --> 37:09.360
You—

37:09.590 --> 37:11.840
just tell me where the bird's nest is,
that's enough.

37:11.840 --> 37:13.070
Can I use this instead?

37:13.070 --> 37:13.850
Sure.

37:14.070 --> 37:15.540
Genuine wolf-hair brush.

37:16.880 --> 37:18.190
Then I'll roll it.

37:18.920 --> 37:20.050
Roll it! Roll it! Roll it!

37:20.050 --> 37:21.450
Roll it! Roll it! Roll it!

37:25.360 --> 37:26.030
Deer antler,

37:26.030 --> 37:26.670
wolf-hair brush,

37:26.670 --> 37:27.800
lingzhi mushrooms—

37:28.880 --> 37:31.410
my father will be overjoyed
when he finds out.

37:38.510 --> 37:39.480
Ginseng boy,

37:40.230 --> 37:41.760
we're rich!

37:48.710 --> 37:50.480
Little one,

37:51.460 --> 37:53.860
are you playing here by yourself?

37:56.280 --> 37:57.950
You're so adorable—

37:58.190 --> 38:00.000
let me tie a red string on you.

38:00.550 --> 38:01.400
Good boy.

38:01.800 --> 38:02.400
Here we go.

38:09.880 --> 38:11.400
So pretty.

38:15.360 --> 38:16.290
There, all done.

38:21.550 --> 38:22.760
Thank you, lady.

38:22.760 --> 38:24.510
These red strings are for you—

38:24.510 --> 38:27.110
to give to your destined one.

38:32.110 --> 38:33.800
Isn't it said
that if you tie a red string on it,

38:33.800 --> 38:35.150
it turns into ginseng?

38:38.740 --> 38:39.960
So polite, though.

38:45.400 --> 38:46.020
Xiao Yao,

38:46.230 --> 38:47.000
I've prepared—

38:47.000 --> 38:48.150
Sorry, wrong room.

38:55.280 --> 38:57.130
This seems to be my room.

38:58.670 --> 38:59.320
I prepared

39:00.190 --> 39:01.320
something for you.

39:15.510 --> 39:16.030
This—

39:16.630 --> 39:18.030
a bright-red gauze canopy?

39:18.030 --> 39:20.070
Why does it look like part of a dowry?

39:24.110 --> 39:25.350
Don't all young girls

39:25.800 --> 39:27.060
like things like this?

39:27.550 --> 39:29.030
Who's a "young girl"?

39:29.030 --> 39:30.420
I'm not young!

39:30.760 --> 39:32.320
I've lived for over a thousand years.

39:32.320 --> 39:33.560
Compared to me,

39:33.800 --> 39:35.660
aren't you a young girl in my eyes?

39:36.920 --> 39:38.030
Fair point…

39:39.630 --> 39:40.440
You old demon.

39:42.280 --> 39:42.940
Demon Lord,

39:43.440 --> 39:44.770
the Eternal Demon Lord.

39:46.360 --> 39:46.880
Here,

39:48.740 --> 39:50.670
I'll give you something in return—

39:51.070 --> 39:52.480
you're welcome.

39:52.480 --> 39:53.090
Stop!

40:01.030 --> 40:01.560
Xiao Yao,

40:01.800 --> 40:03.600
do you realize what you've done?

40:04.700 --> 40:06.630
Why did that red string disappear?

40:07.000 --> 40:08.480
That's not something you wear

40:08.480 --> 40:09.880
or give away so casually.

40:10.190 --> 40:11.630
It's not an ordinary red string—

40:11.630 --> 40:14.830
it's the red matchmaking thread
of the red-thread demon.

40:14.870 --> 40:16.710
Then why was it on Ginseng boy?

40:17.440 --> 40:18.310
I'll go find him to undo it.

40:18.310 --> 40:19.710
Stay right where you are!

40:20.510 --> 40:21.970
That's not "Ginseng boy"—

40:22.030 --> 40:23.920
it's the red-thread demon's
second generation disciple.

40:23.920 --> 40:27.980
Alright, alright, the red-thread demon's
second generation disciple.

40:28.370 --> 40:29.770
Why are you following me?

40:40.890 --> 40:43.350
Now do you understand
why I'm following you?

40:47.230 --> 40:48.960
Could it be that this red string

40:49.180 --> 40:50.540
won't let us separate?

40:50.760 --> 40:52.760
It's more than just not separating.

40:53.280 --> 40:55.710
The red matchmaking thread
of the red-thread demon

40:55.710 --> 40:57.910
is created for romance between demons.

40:58.630 --> 40:59.760
It has three stages.

41:00.590 --> 41:02.520
Only after all three are completed

41:02.590 --> 41:04.030
can it dissolve on its own.

41:04.030 --> 41:05.590
What are the three stages?

41:05.960 --> 41:06.880
First stage:

41:07.710 --> 41:09.640
The two connected by the red thread

41:10.590 --> 41:12.340
cannot be more than ten feet apart.

41:12.340 --> 41:13.110
Ten feet?

41:19.190 --> 41:19.990
Second stage:

41:20.590 --> 41:23.200
They will share feelings and sensations.

41:24.070 --> 41:25.800
Feelings and sensations.

41:26.440 --> 41:28.640
-What's the third stage?
-Don't worry—

41:28.840 --> 41:30.770
we won't make it to the third stage.

41:31.110 --> 41:31.710
Why?

41:32.510 --> 41:34.150
You're not going to eat me, are you?

41:34.150 --> 41:35.100
My Lord,

41:35.230 --> 41:37.070
the cleansing ceremony
to welcome Demon Lord

41:37.070 --> 41:38.230
has been prepared.

41:38.230 --> 41:39.290
Prepare to depart.

41:39.960 --> 41:40.800
Where to?

41:41.840 --> 41:43.030
After you, my Lord.

41:46.320 --> 41:47.090
My Lord,

41:47.190 --> 41:48.550
the cleansing ceremony
is no small matter.

41:48.550 --> 41:50.190
You cannot take Xiao Yao with you.

41:50.190 --> 41:50.710
Let go—

41:52.440 --> 41:53.250
you, let go.

41:56.630 --> 41:58.960
I have made my decision.
Do not bring it up again.

41:58.960 --> 41:59.490
Let's go.

41:59.590 --> 42:01.040
My Lord!

42:03.360 --> 42:03.960
My Lord,

42:04.960 --> 42:07.510
first you risked yourself
to save her from Hei Wu,

42:07.510 --> 42:09.760
then you sent her to Moon-Gazing Terrace
to study and cultivate.

42:09.760 --> 42:12.630
You even prepared gauze canopies
and bedding for her—

42:12.630 --> 42:13.190
and now,

42:13.760 --> 42:15.960
do you want her to serve you personally?

42:16.880 --> 42:18.510
You are the Monarch of All Demons.

42:18.510 --> 42:19.440
Acting like this

42:19.710 --> 42:21.480
could undermine your authority.

42:21.480 --> 42:22.680
You think I want this?

42:22.960 --> 42:23.710
If it weren't for us…

42:23.710 --> 42:24.510
You—be quiet.

42:27.590 --> 42:28.790
And you—be quiet too.

42:57.760 --> 42:59.960
My Lord, the auspicious hour has arrived.

42:59.960 --> 43:02.420
All unrelated personnel, please withdraw.

43:04.880 --> 43:06.140
For today's ceremony,

43:06.400 --> 43:07.800
Xiao Yao shall attend me.

43:11.320 --> 43:12.520
You may instruct her.

43:33.550 --> 43:35.260
First: Fragrant herbs

43:35.360 --> 43:37.340
to clear away impurities.

43:46.510 --> 43:47.880
Xiao Yao! Xiao Yao!

44:15.960 --> 44:17.000
M-My lord!

44:18.670 --> 44:19.280
Continue.

44:21.110 --> 44:22.640
Second: Bathe in holy water

44:22.710 --> 44:23.880
to wash away calamity.

44:23.880 --> 44:24.590
Water?

44:29.960 --> 44:30.900
I can do this.

44:31.000 --> 44:31.440
Good.

44:33.670 --> 44:34.800
This water needs—

44:38.710 --> 44:39.320
Next?

44:41.230 --> 44:41.760
Hmmm...

44:44.360 --> 44:45.230
Keep going.

44:47.800 --> 44:51.060
Third: Wield the willow branch
for fortune and longevity.

44:56.510 --> 44:57.440
Wield.

45:02.070 --> 45:03.070
Really?

45:03.320 --> 45:03.800
Mm-hmm.

45:13.830 --> 45:14.960
Forgive me, my Lord!

45:15.920 --> 45:16.520
Withdraw.

45:17.590 --> 45:18.070
My Lord.

45:18.320 --> 45:19.250
I said withdraw!

45:19.400 --> 45:20.960
No, I mean—weren't you bound to me—

45:20.960 --> 45:21.490
To wield,

45:22.110 --> 45:23.190
not to strike.

45:23.190 --> 45:23.760
Right, then—

45:23.760 --> 45:24.960
the c-cleansing ceremony is concluded.

45:24.960 --> 45:25.440
Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!

45:25.440 --> 45:26.960
Let's go! Move it! Hurry up!

45:26.960 --> 45:27.820
Run, let's run!

45:29.880 --> 45:31.000
I don't know how to do this!

45:31.000 --> 45:33.030
You're forcing me into something
I've never done—

45:33.030 --> 45:35.400
I've never waited on anyone in my life.

45:35.400 --> 45:37.400
Even though my family was poor
when I was little,

45:37.400 --> 45:39.650
we never had to serve others like this.

46:24.400 --> 46:28.030
All hail the return of the Demon Lord
to the realm of the living!

46:28.320 --> 46:32.220
All hail the return of the Demon Lord
to the realm of the living!

46:32.360 --> 46:36.030
All hail the return of the Demon Lord
to the realm of the living!

46:36.320 --> 46:40.440
All hail the return of the Demon Lord
to the realm of the living!
